cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GWM-Pilot v1: A Reversible Yang-Mills Stack for Geometric Deep Learning"
abstract: >
  Pilot release of a reversible Yang-Mills stack with symplectic
  integration. Contains the verification results, trained models, and
  the pilot's central technical finding: the A-update rule is strictly
  local in voxel space, which determines when the architecture
  succeeds (local A-processing) and when it fails (non-local transport).
authors:
